WEBVTT

00:00:00.378 --> 00:00:01.845
The Children...

00:00:02.714 --> 00:00:03.682
released!

00:00:03.682 --> 00:00:03.882
<<RELEASED>>
released!

00:00:03.882 --> 00:00:04.143
<<RELEASED>>

00:00:04.482 --> 00:00:06.109
Swift as the wind!

00:00:06.584 --> 00:00:08.575
Silent as the forest.

00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:10.821
Aggressive as fire!

00:00:11.189 --> 00:00:13.458
Immovable as a mountain!

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.119
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:19.764
And so, just wait for us, snowy mountain!

00:00:19.764 --> 00:00:20.662
Meaning what?

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:22.734
It's not like the mountain's running from us.

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:26.171
Come on, can't we take the car?
Why do we have to ski there?

00:00:26.171 --> 00:00:28.506
Don't be silly! Because the mountain's THERE!

00:00:28.506 --> 00:00:30.474
We'd get there faster by car.

00:00:30.542 --> 00:00:33.244
And skiing will get us there, too!
It's only human!

00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:35.542
Like we won't be skiing
enough once we get there?

00:00:41.486 --> 00:00:45.056
According to the GPS,
it should be around here, but...

00:00:45.056 --> 00:00:48.890
Oh, man. I didn't expect this blizzard.

00:00:49.828 --> 00:00:53.164
Can't you just teleport us directly over there?

00:00:53.164 --> 00:00:54.722
This blizzard makes it hard.

00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:57.602
Which is why I said we should have driven!

00:00:57.602 --> 00:01:02.130
You get tired too easily for a young guy!
I'm pulling the other two!

00:01:03.108 --> 00:01:04.342
Besides...

00:01:04.342 --> 00:01:09.481
Look at this lovely triple axle!
My exceptional beauty and technique!

00:01:09.481 --> 00:01:12.984
That's an absolute lie. And it's not skiing!

00:01:12.984 --> 00:01:13.752
Here you go.

00:01:13.752 --> 00:01:14.810
Hm? Right!

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:18.356
Special esper, Kaoru Akashi! Release, cancel!

00:01:18.356 --> 00:01:19.550
Limiter on!

00:01:31.202 --> 00:01:33.905
You rely on your ESP too much!

00:01:33.905 --> 00:01:36.741
I'm going home! I'm tired and this sucks!

00:01:36.741 --> 00:01:39.010
Going home? After coming all this way?

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.068
Mr. Minamoto?

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:43.908
There it is!

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:55.619
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:01:56.628 --> 00:02:02.498
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:04.936 --> 00:02:10.738
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:02:11.076 --> 00:02:15.945
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:02:17.215 --> 00:02:22.744
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:02:23.154 --> 00:02:27.750
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:02:28.359 --> 00:02:31.262
Limiter (changing myself)

00:02:31.262 --> 00:02:34.390
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:02:34.532 --> 00:02:40.266
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:02:41.706 --> 00:02:44.275
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:02:44.275 --> 00:02:47.108
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:02:47.345 --> 00:02:53.511
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:02:53.651 --> 00:02:56.454
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:02:56.454 --> 00:02:59.090
Sora e karitateru yo

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:04.790
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:10.693
Zettai karen my wings

00:03:18.943 --> 00:03:22.247
40th sense:
"Tsubomi Mountain Retreat! Break In!"
This is Director Tsubomi's vacation house.
The family villa of Baron Tsubomi.

00:03:22.247 --> 00:03:23.148
This is Director Tsubomi's vacation house.
The family villa of Baron Tsubomi.

00:03:23.148 --> 00:03:24.282
It's huge!

00:03:24.282 --> 00:03:25.617
So much land!

00:03:25.617 --> 00:03:28.119
Amazing doesn't even begin to describe this!

00:03:28.119 --> 00:03:29.347
Welcome!

00:03:29.787 --> 00:03:32.312
Don't tell me you skied here.

00:03:33.324 --> 00:03:35.527
They insisted.

00:03:35.527 --> 00:03:37.222
Hello!

00:03:37.595 --> 00:03:39.256
Are the others here yet?

00:03:41.533 --> 00:03:43.125
A drill?!

00:03:46.004 --> 00:03:48.598
That's a modified special snow tractor, isn't it?

00:03:51.376 --> 00:03:52.510
Doubleface?

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.279
Miss Hotaru! Miss Natsuko!

00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:56.047
Thanks for inviting us!

00:03:56.047 --> 00:03:57.776
And I came, too.

00:03:57.849 --> 00:03:59.214
Oh, Dr. Sakaki, too.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.543
I made special arrangements for them.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.589
Well, it was nice enough on
the snow-covered roads, but...

00:04:04.589 --> 00:04:06.090
Along the way...

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.251
We merged onto the freeway, and... Well...

00:04:19.103 --> 00:04:20.331
That drill...

00:04:20.605 --> 00:04:23.741
Hey, look at that! That's absolutely a drill!

00:04:23.741 --> 00:04:24.142
That drill...

00:04:24.142 --> 00:04:24.475
Yeah, it really is a drill. How daring!
That drill...

00:04:24.475 --> 00:04:27.145
Yeah, it really is a drill. How daring!

00:04:27.145 --> 00:04:27.946
That drill...

00:04:27.946 --> 00:04:31.683
Amazing! Amazing! Amazing!
The ultimate drill, huh?

00:04:31.683 --> 00:04:33.451
That drill...

00:04:33.451 --> 00:04:36.421
I hear them! Everyone's talking about this drill!

00:04:36.421 --> 00:04:37.581
Stop it!

00:04:37.655 --> 00:04:39.891
God, they're all staring at the drill!

00:04:39.891 --> 00:04:42.121
They're all! Don't look at us!

00:04:43.261 --> 00:04:45.388
Tough trip, huh?

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.088
That just leaves...

00:04:50.735 --> 00:04:52.637
Thank you for having us!

00:04:52.637 --> 00:04:54.832
Hello. Is everyone here?

00:04:56.574 --> 00:04:59.168
Oh? Where are Hatsune and Supervisor Kojika?

00:04:59.711 --> 00:05:00.912
About that...

00:05:00.912 --> 00:05:03.181
They went to an anime movie premiere event.

00:05:03.181 --> 00:05:04.749
It brings tears to my eyes!

00:05:04.749 --> 00:05:05.716
I want to eat fish!

00:05:06.417 --> 00:05:08.820
So, even though they were invited...

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.981
We still came!

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.060
As The Hound's supervisor,
I need to show up for these things.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:17.322
Thank ya!

00:05:18.096 --> 00:05:19.430
My contribution.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:22.800
Lovely! Let's start the party!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.802
Ms. Maid, take care of this.

00:05:24.802 --> 00:05:26.565
Yes, Madam!

00:05:26.804 --> 00:05:27.930
Miss Suetsumu?

00:05:29.107 --> 00:05:32.736
When will you get it through your head?!
It's "miss", not " madam"!

00:05:33.111 --> 00:05:36.308
Forgive me, Madam... I mean, Miss.

00:05:36.781 --> 00:05:38.082
Why are you her maid?

00:05:38.082 --> 00:05:40.752
The top people from BABEL are here!

00:05:40.752 --> 00:05:45.780
Besides, getting ordered around while
wearing this is kind of a turn-on.

00:05:46.324 --> 00:05:48.026
Whoa. She's an "M".

00:05:48.026 --> 00:05:48.893
An "M".

00:05:48.893 --> 00:05:49.694
Total "M".

00:05:49.694 --> 00:05:50.683
Yeah.

00:05:50.962 --> 00:05:51.863
Yahoo!

00:05:51.863 --> 00:05:52.764
Here we go!

00:05:52.764 --> 00:05:53.890
Paparapa!

00:05:54.766 --> 00:05:56.768
You tricky, little! You're doing it again!

00:05:56.768 --> 00:05:59.671
That's no fair!
I'll turn your limiters to full!

00:05:59.671 --> 00:06:01.139
Hippity-hop!

00:06:01.139 --> 00:06:03.039
Hatsune! Wait up!

00:06:03.875 --> 00:06:07.278
If only Hatsune could always be this calm...

00:06:07.278 --> 00:06:09.746
And as soon as I say it! NO!

00:06:13.484 --> 00:06:17.255
Why? Why is she skiing with Sakaki?!

00:06:17.255 --> 00:06:19.757
I wanted to leave passionate
ski tracks with Naomi!

00:06:19.757 --> 00:06:22.453
Just how far do they think they can push me?!

00:06:22.593 --> 00:06:25.756
OH MY GOD!

00:06:26.364 --> 00:06:28.399
This...

00:06:28.399 --> 00:06:29.923
is bad.

00:06:30.001 --> 00:06:32.231
OH MY GOD!

00:06:36.808 --> 00:06:38.976
Are you all right?

00:06:38.976 --> 00:06:42.844
You're worried about a guy like him?
You're a nice girl, Naomi!

00:06:43.881 --> 00:06:45.781
Naomi...

00:06:45.883 --> 00:06:48.953
Can't leave trash on the ski slope, can we?

00:06:48.953 --> 00:06:51.080
You're a good girl, Naomi.

00:06:52.023 --> 00:06:56.119
Dotoro, Dotoro. My neighbor, Dotoro...
Men! Money! Brand names!
Old age! Expensive lingerie!

00:06:56.761 --> 00:07:00.595
So, what's your ulterior motive
in gathering us here today?

00:07:00.998 --> 00:07:04.535
Please! I have no ulterior motives!

00:07:04.535 --> 00:07:09.404
We've been through a lot lately.
We all need a rest, right?

00:07:09.741 --> 00:07:10.639
Director...

00:07:11.175 --> 00:07:15.079
Things may get even tougher for us.

00:07:15.079 --> 00:07:16.637
Indeed.

00:07:17.115 --> 00:07:19.606
And actually, I have another
objective in doing this.

00:07:21.085 --> 00:07:24.111
My skin's been so dry lately!

00:07:25.623 --> 00:07:29.894
I'll use this chance to grab some
more of Minamoto's energy.

00:07:29.894 --> 00:07:31.295
Miss...

00:07:31.295 --> 00:07:33.320
That's totally an ulterior motive!

00:07:33.798 --> 00:07:37.101
Okay, everyone! You've all done a great job!

00:07:37.101 --> 00:07:39.137
Let's leave all the office
formality behind for today!

00:07:39.137 --> 00:07:40.204
Cheers!

00:07:40.204 --> 00:07:42.172
Cheers!

00:07:44.275 --> 00:07:46.978
The mansion's old and hasn't been used much,

00:07:46.978 --> 00:07:49.514
but now that it's been cleaned up,
use it as you like.

00:07:49.514 --> 00:07:52.506
We have plenty of rooms and
even an open-air bath.

00:07:53.718 --> 00:07:54.685
Bath?

00:07:54.919 --> 00:07:59.618
And the building's been ESP-shielded,
so privacy is assured.

00:08:03.127 --> 00:08:05.789
If privacy's ensured, that means!

00:08:10.168 --> 00:08:11.736
Eat slower.

00:08:11.736 --> 00:08:15.001
In short, feel free to get
drunk and do what you like!

00:08:17.909 --> 00:08:19.010
Director!

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:19.669
Kidding.

00:08:21.679 --> 00:08:23.214
That means...

00:08:23.214 --> 00:08:25.016
I can make my move, right?

00:08:25.016 --> 00:08:29.783
Yes! Tonight's the night!
Naomi will fall to my charms!

00:08:30.888 --> 00:08:31.946
Here, Supervisor.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:35.059
That's my Naomi. So thoughtful.

00:08:35.059 --> 00:08:37.195
There you go, Supervisor. Drink up!

00:08:37.195 --> 00:08:39.095
Yes! For I am a man!

00:08:43.067 --> 00:08:45.934
Offense is the best defense, right?

00:08:47.171 --> 00:08:48.832
Smooth move.

00:08:49.006 --> 00:08:51.474
You crazy drunk! Leave me alone, please!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.145
Granny! Leave him alone!

00:08:54.145 --> 00:08:55.446
Ew! That's gross!

00:08:55.446 --> 00:08:56.504
You can't have him!

00:09:01.853 --> 00:09:03.343
I can't resist!

00:09:03.621 --> 00:09:06.057
Um, Madam... I mean, Miss?

00:09:06.057 --> 00:09:07.422
Quit it! Quit it! Quit it!

00:09:09.026 --> 00:09:09.961
Minamoto?

00:09:09.961 --> 00:09:12.521
Well, I think I'll call it a night...

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:13.790
Hold it!

00:09:14.198 --> 00:09:15.893
There's more?

00:09:16.067 --> 00:09:18.695
There's something I need you to make clear!

00:09:19.036 --> 00:09:21.939
There was a woman when you were
in Comerica, wasn't there?!

00:09:21.939 --> 00:09:23.065
Tell me!

00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:24.909
Tell me! Admit it! Come on! Dish it! Spill it!

00:09:24.909 --> 00:09:26.310
Director!
Tell me! Admit it! Come on! Dish it! Spill it!

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:27.778
Shouldn't we stop her?
Tell me! Admit it! Come on! Dish it! Spill it!

00:09:27.778 --> 00:09:29.680
Yeah, but...
Tell me! Admit it! Come on! Dish it! Spill it!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.409
I want to hear more.
Tell me! Admit it! Come on! Dish it! Spill it!

00:09:32.016 --> 00:09:34.075
Miss Kashiwagi! Save me!

00:09:34.819 --> 00:09:37.014
Well? Is it true?

00:09:37.221 --> 00:09:39.951
What was she like?! I wanna know!

00:09:42.727 --> 00:09:45.630
K-Kashiwagi? Even you?

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:46.731
I want to hear, too!

00:09:46.731 --> 00:09:47.732
Me, too!

00:09:47.732 --> 00:09:49.063
Um... Me, three.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.359
Oh, I know about that.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.430
H-Hey!

00:09:53.638 --> 00:09:59.076
Yeah, back in college, there was a
girl in the ESP research program.

00:09:59.076 --> 00:10:00.778
And?

00:10:00.778 --> 00:10:01.870
One day...

00:10:03.848 --> 00:10:04.940
She and him...

00:10:08.619 --> 00:10:11.850
Kids at home, never hit
anyone with a beer bottle.

00:10:12.223 --> 00:10:14.418
You shouldn't drink too much, RIGHT?

00:10:14.559 --> 00:10:16.160
Um... I guess.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.562
Maybe you're right.

00:10:17.562 --> 00:10:18.824
You might be right.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:20.791
Still want to drink?!

00:10:21.132 --> 00:10:23.301
Wh-Why don't we take a bath?

00:10:23.301 --> 00:10:24.569
R-Right?

00:10:24.569 --> 00:10:26.070
The bath's this way!

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:28.664
I wonder what it's like. Can't wait to see it!

00:10:28.739 --> 00:10:30.408
I'll see to the boiler.

00:10:30.408 --> 00:10:32.968
Um, yay! Obligatory bath scene!

00:10:33.377 --> 00:10:35.504
I'll be going to bed, then.

00:10:38.449 --> 00:10:41.319
Akira, should we try the bath, too?

00:10:41.319 --> 00:10:42.286
I guess.

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:51.691
First!

00:10:58.769 --> 00:11:01.339
Can't you keep your mouth shut?

00:11:01.339 --> 00:11:03.500
Minamoto! It's amazing, Minamoto!

00:11:04.241 --> 00:11:06.368
In the bath! It's amazing!

00:11:07.712 --> 00:11:09.043
In the bath?

00:11:09.313 --> 00:11:10.381
What's amazing?

00:11:10.381 --> 00:11:11.449
The boobs!

00:11:11.449 --> 00:11:12.609
Boobs?

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.039
Boobs!

00:11:14.352 --> 00:11:15.979
They're huge, but they just float!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:26.163
The administrator, Miss Oboro,
Natsuko, Hotaru, Naomi...

00:11:26.163 --> 00:11:27.596
A whole fleet of 'em!

00:11:28.499 --> 00:11:30.034
A fleet?!

00:11:30.034 --> 00:11:31.602
Right. A fleet.

00:11:31.602 --> 00:11:32.970
It's amazing!

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:35.940
There's a sight like that in the bath?!

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:40.344
Well, breasts are mainly fat, which is
less dense that water, so they float.

00:11:40.344 --> 00:11:41.178
No kidding.

00:11:41.178 --> 00:11:42.873
Good for you, Kaoru!

00:11:45.249 --> 00:11:46.648
That's all I wanted. Later!

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:50.621
BATH!

00:11:50.621 --> 00:11:53.624
To the open-air bath! To the fleet!

00:11:53.624 --> 00:11:55.717
BOOBS!

00:11:57.762 --> 00:12:00.631
Uh-oh... Now I'm dizzy.

00:12:00.631 --> 00:12:05.398
Chief, you're old enough to know not to
hold your breath under water in a bath.

00:12:06.871 --> 00:12:08.566
I'm getting out.

00:12:12.243 --> 00:12:14.177
My butt fell asleep!

00:12:15.479 --> 00:12:18.846
DAMMIT! This isn't the women's bath!

00:12:18.949 --> 00:12:22.817
And I'll never get THAT image out of my brain!

00:12:23.621 --> 00:12:24.417
Ayami!

00:12:24.488 --> 00:12:25.056
Yuika!

00:12:25.056 --> 00:12:25.790
Suzuka!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.280
Karen Girls!

00:12:30.194 --> 00:12:32.856
Always stay lovely, girls!

00:12:34.298 --> 00:12:35.900
Heavenly.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.334
What a nice bath.

00:12:37.334 --> 00:12:40.738
It's a natural hot spring.
It'll make your skin smooth.

00:12:40.738 --> 00:12:42.640
Natsuko's skin will be so smooth now.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:44.005
And yours, Hotaru.

00:12:45.209 --> 00:12:47.734
Hot spring eggs! Thank ya!

00:12:47.812 --> 00:12:49.541
It's good to be alive!

00:12:50.314 --> 00:12:52.249
If my eyes were cameras...

00:12:52.249 --> 00:12:53.117
Where's Shiho?

00:12:53.117 --> 00:12:55.278
And if my mouth was a printer...

00:12:56.921 --> 00:12:58.411
Shiho isn't here!

00:13:04.428 --> 00:13:07.090
I think Mr. Minamoto's room is this way.

00:13:08.099 --> 00:13:10.935
There was a woman when you were
in Comerica, wasn't there?!

00:13:10.935 --> 00:13:12.027
Tell me!

00:13:13.404 --> 00:13:18.205
I have to scan him for that story while the
memories are still fresh in his mind.

00:13:22.346 --> 00:13:23.176
Even so...

00:13:24.014 --> 00:13:27.882
This place feels creepy... And I hate creepiness.

00:13:30.988 --> 00:13:32.250
Who... Who's there?!

00:13:40.898 --> 00:13:42.957
N-Nobody!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.037
Shiho!

00:13:47.037 --> 00:13:48.129
Stop!

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.675
No good. I can't do a remote scan.

00:13:51.675 --> 00:13:53.878
I can't hear anything, either.

00:13:53.878 --> 00:13:56.480
You said the mansion's ESP-shielded, right?

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.349
Right, and teleportation isn't possible, either.

00:13:58.349 --> 00:13:58.974
Shiho!

00:14:00.017 --> 00:14:01.746
Naomi... Tonight...

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.288
You've found Shiho?

00:14:04.288 --> 00:14:05.983
Yes, but...

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.326
Whatever happened caused a severe shock.

00:14:09.326 --> 00:14:10.828
Shiho, what happened?!

00:14:10.828 --> 00:14:12.125
Snap out of it!

00:14:12.663 --> 00:14:13.630
Well?

00:14:14.331 --> 00:14:15.992
"I'm sorry"?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.836
"I'll be a good girl from now on."

00:14:18.836 --> 00:14:23.240
"I won't peek into the darkness of peoples'
hearts for fun ever again."

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:24.942
Sh-Shiho!

00:14:24.942 --> 00:14:26.273
What happened?!

00:14:27.178 --> 00:14:28.236
"Another..."

00:14:28.746 --> 00:14:31.977
"There's another person in this mansion..."

00:14:33.951 --> 00:14:36.287
Where's Dr. Sakaki?! If he scanned her, then!

00:14:36.287 --> 00:14:38.722
I think he's still unconscious.

00:14:38.722 --> 00:14:40.849
Typically useless when we need him most.

00:14:40.925 --> 00:14:42.293
And whose fault is that?!

00:14:42.293 --> 00:14:45.091
But for Shiho to have been scared this badly...

00:14:45.529 --> 00:14:47.898
Maybe something appeared in the mansion.

00:14:47.898 --> 00:14:51.356
Like a ghost, or a monster, or a curse.

00:14:52.603 --> 00:14:54.969
That's absurd. There are no such things!

00:14:55.272 --> 00:14:58.042
You're positive about that?
Nothing awful ever happened here?

00:14:58.042 --> 00:14:58.809
Of course not!

00:14:58.809 --> 00:14:59.969
What's this?

00:15:01.478 --> 00:15:03.147
Old blood stains.

00:15:03.147 --> 00:15:04.478
And bullet holes.

00:15:04.782 --> 00:15:05.714
Huh?!

00:15:06.784 --> 00:15:08.419
Oh, about that...

00:15:08.419 --> 00:15:10.187
About WHAT?!

00:15:10.187 --> 00:15:11.552
A long time ago...

00:15:12.323 --> 00:15:14.757
A person was shot in the head here.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.889
So, something awful DID happen!

00:15:18.662 --> 00:15:20.095
I suppose, but...

00:15:21.165 --> 00:15:25.602
The "ghost" from that is still out and about.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.472
Shiho said there was another here.

00:15:28.472 --> 00:15:30.099
Maybe someone who's snuck in?

00:15:30.374 --> 00:15:33.036
The building may be old,
but it has the latest security.

00:15:33.544 --> 00:15:34.678
But!

00:15:34.678 --> 00:15:36.914
I'm telling you to relax! After all...

00:15:36.914 --> 00:15:38.677
Actually, Miss...

00:15:39.216 --> 00:15:43.585
Um... M-Maybe we should prepare, just in case!

00:15:45.356 --> 00:15:48.189
Let's check inside the mansion! Go! Go!

00:15:48.525 --> 00:15:49.994
R-Right.

00:15:49.994 --> 00:15:51.662
Let's check it out.

00:15:51.662 --> 00:15:52.356
Right.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:53.964
Let's go, too.

00:15:53.964 --> 00:15:55.399
Right. Hatsune!

00:15:55.399 --> 00:15:56.734
Hatsune is going!

00:15:56.734 --> 00:15:58.769
Be careful, everyone!

00:15:58.769 --> 00:16:00.771
You're coming too, Chief!

00:16:00.771 --> 00:16:01.863
But, I'm scared!

00:16:08.579 --> 00:16:11.382
You two should go back to your rooms.

00:16:11.382 --> 00:16:13.350
I'll stay with Shiho.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:16.945
The only people in this room who are
awake are Minamoto and Miss Suetsumu!

00:16:18.155 --> 00:16:20.190
Feel free to do what you like!

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:22.927
What if we're not here and
you accidentally wake her up?!

00:16:22.927 --> 00:16:24.962
Ew! Mr. Minamoto, that's gross!

00:16:24.962 --> 00:16:26.130
We won't do that!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.121
She's a nurse! Did you forget that?!

00:16:28.465 --> 00:16:30.034
That's beside the point!

00:16:30.034 --> 00:16:31.835
She's a woman first, then a nurse!

00:16:31.835 --> 00:16:32.802
Well, I suppose, but...

00:16:33.003 --> 00:16:36.807
Besides, Shiho's being here means she
might have been making a move on her own!

00:16:36.807 --> 00:16:39.241
There's no way we can go to sleep tonight!

00:16:39.743 --> 00:16:41.301
Absolutely no way!

00:16:47.751 --> 00:16:50.621
Despite what they say,
they're still just little kids.

00:16:50.621 --> 00:16:54.425
Miss Suetsumu. Sorry about all this.

00:16:54.425 --> 00:16:55.790
Especially with Shiho.

00:16:58.562 --> 00:17:00.655
You figured it all out, haven't you?

00:17:01.298 --> 00:17:03.934
It wasn't a particularly difficult deduction.

00:17:03.934 --> 00:17:06.061
A mansion that no one could enter.

00:17:06.503 --> 00:17:08.403
The one person not in the bath.

00:17:08.839 --> 00:17:10.670
Director Tsubomi's behavior.

00:17:11.275 --> 00:17:15.371
And your telepathically-based
transformation ability.

00:17:16.814 --> 00:17:20.477
So, it's not much of a stretch to
realize that isn't your real face!

00:17:23.587 --> 00:17:27.491
Yes. When I checked the
boiler prior to everyone...

00:17:27.491 --> 00:17:31.028
getting in the bath, I got oil on my face.

00:17:31.028 --> 00:17:33.155
I got distracted when I went
to wipe it, and accidentally...

00:17:34.164 --> 00:17:35.222
changed to this face.

00:17:35.899 --> 00:17:37.992
BOOM!

00:17:46.543 --> 00:17:47.878
Th-Thanks.

00:17:47.878 --> 00:17:50.608
B-B-But why did you hide this?

00:17:50.948 --> 00:17:54.782
Because... Because of the impact this face has!

00:17:56.487 --> 00:18:00.758
I screwed up the heart rate and
blood pressure of countless patients!

00:18:00.758 --> 00:18:02.259
Even poor Shiho!

00:18:02.259 --> 00:18:03.627
That's why I...

00:18:03.627 --> 00:18:08.132
But isn't that more a problem with
your presentation and not your face?

00:18:08.132 --> 00:18:09.656
Maybe. Ideally.

00:18:10.401 --> 00:18:17.102
But everyone prefers a pretty face.
Even you, Mr. Minamoto!

00:18:17.508 --> 00:18:19.738
You went out with this beautiful girl, didn't you?!

00:18:21.779 --> 00:18:22.803
Carry?

00:18:25.449 --> 00:18:26.717
Oh! And then what?

00:18:26.717 --> 00:18:28.719
And just how deep a relationship
was this, specifically?

00:18:28.719 --> 00:18:30.454
She dumped you, didn't she?

00:18:30.454 --> 00:18:32.890
Agh! You're all awake?!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:35.459
Actually, we were talking about
Miss Suetsumu's powers!

00:18:35.459 --> 00:18:37.586
We don't care about that!

00:18:38.095 --> 00:18:40.130
It's like using makeup to make yourself prettier!

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.597
That's normal for a woman!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.635
Well?! Tell us everything!

00:18:44.635 --> 00:18:46.236
It's none of your business!

00:18:46.236 --> 00:18:47.567
Yes, it is!

00:18:48.105 --> 00:18:50.096
How... How, exactly?

00:18:52.943 --> 00:18:55.579
Well, if there's a woman like that...

00:18:55.579 --> 00:18:57.748
You might leave us.

00:18:57.748 --> 00:18:59.545
You're important to us.

00:18:59.983 --> 00:19:01.314
G-Girls...

00:19:02.453 --> 00:19:04.011
Don't worry about that.

00:19:05.589 --> 00:19:10.194
You three are the only girls in my life now.

00:19:10.194 --> 00:19:13.630
So, you don't love this woman at all anymore?!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.599
And you'll be sorry if you lie to us!

00:19:15.599 --> 00:19:18.001
Um, sure... Pretty much...

00:19:18.001 --> 00:19:19.093
Liar!

00:19:19.503 --> 00:19:21.266
You just thought "I still love her a little".

00:19:21.472 --> 00:19:22.773
Dammit!

00:19:22.773 --> 00:19:24.001
Philanderer!

00:19:27.778 --> 00:19:30.848
I'll kill you and then I'll kill myself!
No! I loved her, but it's all over!

00:19:30.848 --> 00:19:34.045
Yeah! I'll get you in a Scorpion hold!
We broke up because I loved her!

00:19:34.251 --> 00:19:37.345
Wait... You left her because you loved her?

00:19:38.489 --> 00:19:40.047
That makes no sense!

00:19:40.357 --> 00:19:42.159
Are you trying to confuse us?!

00:19:42.159 --> 00:19:45.185
You'll understand when you're a little older!

00:19:45.562 --> 00:19:47.325
Enough for today!

00:19:50.601 --> 00:19:52.398
Stay away! I can't take any more from anyone!

00:19:52.603 --> 00:19:54.366
Stop that and just spill the whole story!

00:19:54.705 --> 00:19:56.840
I want the whole truth, with every detail!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.343
And don't even think of trying to
escape from all these espers!

00:19:59.343 --> 00:20:01.334
We'll get it out of you by force, if necessary!

00:20:01.578 --> 00:20:03.881
I wonder what kind of romance it was.

00:20:03.881 --> 00:20:06.008
Ooh, the embarrassing
details of Minamoto's past!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.284
I'm so excited!

00:20:07.284 --> 00:20:08.285
I want to know.

00:20:08.285 --> 00:20:09.183
Me, too.

00:20:09.419 --> 00:20:09.953
Go on.

00:20:09.953 --> 00:20:10.888
Mr. Minamoto!

00:20:10.888 --> 00:20:11.115
Woof!

00:20:11.455 --> 00:20:14.758
See? Everyone wants to hear about your past.

00:20:14.758 --> 00:20:16.282
Go on! Go on! Go on!

00:20:18.228 --> 00:20:19.252
Huh?

00:20:20.531 --> 00:20:21.429
You...

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.931
You...

00:20:27.538 --> 00:20:29.699
YOU!

00:20:35.445 --> 00:20:37.709
The drill?!

00:20:38.048 --> 00:20:40.350
Stop this...

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:41.818
He... He's got a remote!

00:20:41.818 --> 00:20:43.587
Uh-oh! He's really pissed!

00:20:43.587 --> 00:20:45.817
NOW!

00:21:02.639 --> 00:21:04.800
So, it's the same as using makeup...

00:21:05.375 --> 00:21:08.345
Then I'll use this face for
my matchmaking photo.

00:21:08.345 --> 00:21:10.581
He didn't have to get so mad about it.

00:21:10.581 --> 00:21:12.216
So immature...

00:21:12.216 --> 00:21:14.207
You're the most immature one here.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.323
Minamoto is scary! Minamoto is scary!
Hatsune, we'll go see Nyopo! Nyopo!

00:21:19.323 --> 00:21:21.723
Cool! I got to see Mr. Minamoto's manly side!

00:21:21.992 --> 00:21:24.688
It's his fault I got caught up in this filth!

00:21:25.028 --> 00:21:26.757
I'm never going to drink again.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:29.021
The... The fleet!

00:21:29.299 --> 00:21:31.168
We're sorry, we're sorry!

00:21:31.168 --> 00:21:33.470
Not the drill! Anything but the drill!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.836
We'll be good from now on!

00:21:39.009 --> 00:21:39.910
Hey, look.

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:41.241
The drill. That drill's back.

00:21:46.083 --> 00:21:47.251
The drill again?

00:21:47.251 --> 00:21:51.088
That drill's absolutely lovely, isn't it?

00:21:51.088 --> 00:21:51.788
It is?

00:21:51.788 --> 00:21:55.659
Yeah. It's a strong and gallant drill, isn't it?

00:21:55.659 --> 00:21:56.260
Huh?

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:59.593
It'll probably save the world, don't you think?

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:02.633
I can hear them all gossiping about the drill!

00:22:02.633 --> 00:22:03.964
Stop it!

00:22:04.768 --> 00:22:09.000
Don't look! Don't stare at the drill like that!

00:22:20.851 --> 00:22:24.488
Mae wo muite Yume wo daite

00:22:24.488 --> 00:22:28.458
Kokoro kimete Miageru sora

00:22:28.458 --> 00:22:34.498
Mirai wo koeru Watashi no tsubasa de

00:22:34.498 --> 00:22:38.402
Anata dake ga daihon'me!

00:22:38.402 --> 00:22:42.339
Zettai love! Sengen shita

00:22:42.339 --> 00:22:48.244
Kira-kira shiteta kisetsu ga sugiteku

00:22:48.979 --> 00:22:53.050
Kinen shashin no anata wa

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:56.918
Kawaranai komarikao

00:22:57.521 --> 00:23:03.756
Yasashikutte atatakakute namida ga dechau

00:23:04.961 --> 00:23:08.532
Ashita mo koko de aeru mitai ni

00:23:08.532 --> 00:23:12.102
Yakusoku shinaide yukou

00:23:12.102 --> 00:23:16.039
Itsumo no you ni sarigenaku

00:23:16.039 --> 00:23:21.306
Egao de chiisaku te wo futta

00:23:22.312 --> 00:23:27.113
"Jaa... Mata ne"

00:23:40.664 --> 00:23:40.964
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.964 --> 00:23:41.932
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.932 --> 00:23:43.166
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.166 --> 00:23:45.532
I've come for you, Princess Children.

00:23:45.836 --> 00:23:47.704
Please, help me.

00:23:47.704 --> 00:23:48.671
Princess?

00:23:49.072 --> 00:23:50.596
Your Highness, you can't do this!

00:23:50.707 --> 00:23:52.642
The law forbids royalty from
marrying a shrine maiden!

00:23:52.642 --> 00:23:54.200
Esper and Normal! Royalty and shrine maiden!

00:23:54.444 --> 00:23:56.046
They live in different worlds!

00:23:56.046 --> 00:23:57.741
No! I won't give up!

00:23:58.148 --> 00:23:59.516
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:59.516 --> 00:24:03.077
Episode 41: "Marital Vows!
His Highness's Children!"

00:24:03.186 --> 00:24:04.588
I love you, Sera.

00:24:04.588 --> 00:24:06.623
And I love you, Your Highness.

00:24:06.623 --> 00:24:08.692
Marital Vows!
His Highness's Children
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.692 --> 00:24:09.886
Marital Vows!
His Highness's Children
